  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity commitment of up to &#x20ac;40 million in favour of CVI Private Debt Fund II  S.C.A. SICAV-RAIF (the Fund).  The Fund will provide flexible debt financing solutions predominantly to small  and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) mostly via senior/unitranche debt  instruments, with the potential to also execute junior debt transactions. The  Fund will invest primarily in Poland and also in selected opportunities in  other Central and Eastern European (CEE) countries.</narrative>
  </description>
